title: Point the npm homepage at the package's website and link the author
description: "GH issue #182: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-gantt-chart/issues/182 · author @unbraind · created 2026-10-25T21:54:33Z · updated 2026-10-25T21:54:33Z"
